  "question": {
    "text": "If mass is written as <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>k</mi><msup><mi>c</mi><mi>P</mi></msup><msup><mi>G</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo> </mo><msup><mi>h</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math>, then the value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi></math> will be : (Constants have their usual meaning with <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>k</mi></math> a dimensionless constant)",
    "image": null
  },
