  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given:</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>m</mi><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">=</mo><mi>k</mi><msup><mi>c</mi><mi>P</mi></msup><msup><mi>G</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo mathvariant=\"italic\"> </mo><msup><mi>h</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p>Writing dimensions on both sides, we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mn>1</mn></msup><mo> </mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mn>0</mn></msup><mo> </mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mn>0</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><msup><mi>LT</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></msup><msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo> </mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo> </mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><msup><mi>ML</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo> </mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p>By comparing exponent of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></math> on both the sides, we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>=</mo><mi>P</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>⇒</mo><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p></blockquote>",
